The jdv package bundles cJSON v1.7.19 in src/cjson/ for JSON
serialisation. cJSON is copyright (c) 2009-2017 Dave Gamble and
cJSON contributors, distributed under the MIT license. The full
upstream notice is preserved in the header of src/cjson/cJSON.c and
src/cjson/cJSON.h. Upstream source: https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON

Local modifications are tracked in src/cjson/patches/. They cover R package
checks and round-trip number output.

